# Vercel deploys this repository as a STATIC site: the 30 pages,
# impuls.css, assets/ and the rules PDF.
#
# api/ is left out on purpose. Vercel turns every .js file under api/
# into its own serverless function -- the server, every route file and
# the helpers, well over the 12 the Hobby plan allows, so the build
# failed. They are also not functions: they are one Express app, and it
# needs a database that is not hosted anywhere yet.
#
# The pages already cope with the API being absent (each call has a
# fallback), so without it they render, and only the parts that need
# data -- sign-in, forum, leaderboard -- stay empty.
#
# To deploy the full site later, remove the api line below, and first
# turn the API into ONE function (an entry file plus helpers that Vercel
# does not count) with a hosted Postgres behind it.
api
db
qa_frontend.ps1
